{
  "slug": "agentpowers",
  "name": "Agentpowers",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AgentPowers is a marketplace plugin that lets you search, browse, purchase, install, and manage premium AI skills and agents directly inside Claude Code. It provides 26 MCP tools covering marketplace discovery (search, categories, reviews, security scans, seller profiles), full account management (login, logout, profile), Stripe-powered purchase workflows with auto-install, and multi-platform skill management across 12+ AI tools including Claude Code, Claude Desktop, Cursor, Codex, Windsurf, Gemini CLI, and more. Includes 4 MCP resources for proactive context and 2 guided prompts for skill discovery and purchase flows.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, **2 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `ap` (Search, browse, install, and manage AgentPowers marketplace skills and agents), `marketplace-awareness` (Informs Claude about the AgentPowers marketplace)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `PostToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `agentpowers`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install agentpowers@claude-community` from `AgentPowers-AI/agentpowers-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
